&ldquo;seek,&rdquo; &ldquo;intend,&rdquo; &ldquo;plan,&rdquo; &ldquo;goal,&rdquo; &ldquo;estimate,&rdquo; &ldquo;anticipate&rdquo; or
other comparable terms. For example, the Company is using forward-looking statements in this press release when it discusses regaining
compliance with Nasdaq&rsquo;s continued listing requirements, and timing and effect thereof. All statements other than statements of
